  "decision_conditions": [
    "The submitted plans (Drawing Nos. 1693 02-01 and 02-02) are factually inaccurate as they fail to depict the current physical configuration of the buildings on site, which are now adjoined. The applicant has failed to demonstrate, on the balance of probability, that the adjoined structure currently occupying the land is immune from enforcement action under the 4-year rule for operational development. Consequently, the Local Planning Authority cannot certify the development as lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990."
